Tellus - Natural Juice Brand Website 🌿
Welcome to the official repository for Tellus, a premium natural juice brand dedicated to bringing 100% fresh, organic, and health-focused beverages to our customers.
This project is built and managed as a client project, ensuring a sleek, modern, and high-performance web presence.
🎨 Visual Identity & Brand Guidelines
The design system is heavily inspired by nature, freshness, and premium quality, reflecting the core values of Tellus.
Color Palette
￼ Primary Dark Background (⁠#000000⁠ / Dark Shades): Creates a luxurious and elegant contrast, making the vibrant juice colors pop.
￼ Deep Forest Green (⁠#0A2A1A⁠): Represents sustainability, nature, and organic roots (used in the logo and typography).
￼ Lime / Fresh Green (⁠#7CB342⁠): Symbolizes vitality, freshness, and raw fruit ingredients.
￼ Sun Yellow (⁠#FFD54F⁠): Adds warmth, energy, and highlights citrus or tropical fruit elements.
🔑 Keywords & Slogan
￼ Brand Name: Tellus
￼ Core Keywords: Natural juice, 100% fresh, organic beverages, no added sugar, healthy lifestyle, detox juices.
￼ Tagline / Slogan: "Nature in every sip."
📱 Website Structure & Features
The website is structured to provide an intuitive user experience, highlighting products and brand identity seamlessly:
1. Hero Section:
￼ High-impact visual branding with the Tellus logo and tagline.
￼ Quick Call-to-Action (CTA) for ordering or exploring the menu.
2. About Us:
￼ The story behind Tellus, emphasizing farm-to-bottle freshness and natural ingredients.
3. Product Menu:
￼ Showcasing juice categories, ingredients, health benefits, and pricing.
4. Health Benefits / Highlights:
￼ Educational section on vitamins, detox properties, and clean eating.
5. Customer Reviews & Social Proof:
￼ Testimonials and user-generated content to build trust.
6. Footer / Contact:
￼ Location details, social media links, and direct ordering integration (e.g., WhatsApp).
